        "seg_cer": 0.227,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "所以这段时间还有，就是请朋好友聚到一起一首的。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 10.284,
      "end": 13.33,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "可能要去熬夜。那每次熬夜之后呢，",
      "score": 0.1783,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1386,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1577,
        "sc_delta": -0.0191,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.217,
        "seg_cer": 0.143,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "可不可能要去熬夜？那每次熬夜之后呢？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 13.33,
      "end": 16.051,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "那你就感觉睡不够、累啊，熬夜酸、",
      "score": 0.68,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.2135,
        "sc_logprob": -1.2477,
        "sc_delta": -0.0342,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.385,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "那就感觉睡不够，凉，腰也酸。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 16.226,
      "end": 19.98,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "背也痛啊，脸呢又会肿起来。所以长期的熬夜呢，",
      "score": 0.0389,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0724,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0689,
        "sc_delta": 0.0035,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.029,
        "seg_cer": 0.053,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "背也痛啊，脸蛋又会肿起来。所以长期的熬夜呢。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 19.98,
      "end": 23.592,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "还会增加心血管病，甚至是老年痴呆的风险。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0002,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0002,
