        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "还会增加心血管病，甚至是老年痴呆的风险。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 23.592,
      "end": 28.097,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "那有什么办法能够消除你熬夜之后带来的伤害呢？",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0003,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0003,
        "sc_delta": -0.0,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "那有什么办法能够消除你熬夜之后带来的伤害呢？"
      }
    },
    {
